# The M9 sim's walk over the 1489 store (1530), run with `--store real`: a
# device of a home whose first pull kept 300 conversations and 4000
# messages, then a power cycle on the same flash. Run by `just m9-sim-walk`.

dump 01-list.png
down
enter
dump 02-chat.png
hold up 2000
dump 03-chat-up.png
back

# The second boot resumes from the summary log; the open chat reads its
# page from the ring.
reboot
dump 04-list-after-reboot.png
# The bar (1564): the page's name and one word, in the small type.
bar
down
enter
dump 05-chat-after-reboot.png
back

# The type (1532, 1561): the settings' row switches to the large size,
# and the client record keeps it across a power cycle.
home
right
enter
back
dump 06-list-large.png
reboot
dump 07-list-large-after-reboot.png
# The bar in the large type, and the settings' own bar.
bar
home
dump 08-overview.png
bar
back
